<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>脏腑病机 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E8%84%8F%E8%85%91%E7%97%85%E6%9C%BA/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.158.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.4</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Fri, 05 Dec 2025 16:32:22 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E8%84%8F%E8%85%91%E7%97%85%E6%9C%BA/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>肝木篇第二十五</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-25/</link><pubDate>Fri, 05 Dec 2025 16:32:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-25/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>文章通过少师与岐伯的对话，深入探讨了肝（木）的生理病理特性，特别是**“肝郁”**（木郁）的成因、传变规律以及治疗原则，修正了单纯“补肾养肝”的局限性。</description></item><item><title>肺金篇第二十四</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-24/</link><pubDate>Thu, 04 Dec 2025 15:15:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-24/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>文章通过少师与岐伯的对话，深入辨析了肺（金）与脾胃（土）、肝（木）、肾（水）以及火之间的复杂生克制化关系，打破了常规五行生克的简单逻辑，提出了“微火生金”、“金水互生”、“顽金”等深刻的医学理论。</description></item><item><title>通评虚实论篇第二十八</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE28%E9%80%9A%E8%AF%84%E8%99%9A%E5%AE%9E%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AB/</link><pubDate>Wed, 26 Feb 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE28%E9%80%9A%E8%AF%84%E8%99%9A%E5%AE%9E%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AB/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>黄帝与岐伯系统论述了虚实病机的脉症鉴别与治疗原则，重点阐释了通过寸口脉与尺脉的盛衰变化判断病情顺逆，强调四时脉象特征与预后的关系，并详细介绍了针对不同虚实病证的针灸取穴法则和操作要领，体现了&amp;quot;脉症合参、因时施治&amp;quot;的中医诊疗思想。</description></item></channel></rss>